    <bpmn:process id="W_W5260" name="W5260. Trainee Incident Management OHS Violations and Safety Escalation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Workplace safety violation or OHS incident involving trainee
Frequency: Ad-hoc per incident
Volume: ~5-10 escalations annually
Owner: Store Safety Officer
