      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Successful TESDA NC II certification (W5263)
Frequency: Per graduating batch
Volume: ~150-200 conversions annually (approx 70% target)
Owner: HR Recruiter
Participants: Student Trainee, Store Manager, Category Buyer
Source: workflow W5264 — Permanent Employment Transition Interviewing and Store Placement</bpmn:documentation>
